1. `bash scripts/setup_replit.sh`
2. `modal token new` → `modal secret create hf-token HF_TOKEN=...`
3. `python3 replit_runner.py phase1` (1 GPU smoke test)
4. `python3 replit_runner.py phase2` (8 GPU NCCL + ZeRO-3 teszt)
